' Aus test_with.py uebertragen (16 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-07). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== with basic member assign (1)
CLASS Player
    DIM x AS INTEGER
    DIM y AS INTEGER
    DIM hp AS INTEGER
END CLASS

DIM p AS Player
p = NEW Player()
WITH p
    .x = 10
    .y = 20
    .hp = 100
END WITH
PRINT p.x, p.y, p.hp
--- erwartet
10 20 100

